      "value": "@{5e4ca2145f9b3726b3b389e7|full_name}\n\nUsing the assets you have provided I'm able to reproduce the \"Angle\" issue you have described.  I already have a fix for this which I will push through.\n\nHowever the original issue of the physbones freezing and not being able to be grabbed I've not been able to reproduce.  Your steps are detailed and I've followed them as described, so I'm not sure what would be causing the difference here.  At this time I'm using the Avatar 3.8.1 SDK.  I've attached a recording of me following the steps, if you see anything incorrect please let me know.",
